DESCRIPTION >
    Integrations: AI-source pageview traffic, trailing 7d, grouped by platform
    (Promise.all batch). Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp).
    Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/integrations.js:102-111 (queryName
    'integ_ai'). Typed-column translation: properties.site_id -> site_id,
    event -> event_type, properties.ai_source -> ai_source (typed). No
    JSON-bag fields. IDENTICAL query text to alert_ai.pipe
    (api/routes/alerts.js:81) — duplicate logic, Phase-6 consolidation
    candidate (noted, not acted on).
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE integ_ai_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT ai_source, count() AS cnt
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$pageview'
      AND ai_source IS NOT NULL
      AND ai_source != ''
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 7 DAY
    GROUP BY ai_source
    ORDER BY cnt DESC
    LIMIT 10

TYPE endpoint
